  creatureName: Velociraptor
  description: 'Velociraptor seems to be the most fitting choice out of the listed
    options, given that it is a recognizable dinosaur and also has the feathers we
    have made the key indicator of a dino being a dino. Otherwise, if we were to
    include a more obscure/scaled dino, we run the risk of them being confused for
    dragons.

'
